import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="RGB 3D Signs | Colour-Changing LED Signage" description="Ask Manchester Sign Group about RGB 3D signs with colour-changing LED lighting. Based in Manchester, with delivery throughout the United Kingdom.">
  <main class="inner-page">
    <div class="page-head"><small>ILLUMINATED SIGNAGE</small><h1>RGB 3D <em>SIGNS</em></h1><p>Combine raised 3D lettering with RGB lighting for a sign designed to make your brand more noticeable.</p></div>
    <section class="content-card"><h2>What is an RGB 3D sign?</h2><p>An RGB 3D sign combines three-dimensional letters or shapes with red, green and blue LED lighting. Depending on the selected lighting system, RGB LEDs can produce a range of colours and effects. This style may suit businesses that want a more colourful visual identity for a shopfront, display or branded interior.</p><p>The final appearance depends on the lettering design, sign dimensions, lighting components and installation location. Tell us what you want the sign to look like and we can discuss the appropriate specification.</p></section>
    <section class="content-card"><h2>Details to include in your enquiry</h2><ul><li>Your logo, artwork or business name.</li><li>Approximate width and height in centimetres.</li><li>Whether the sign is for indoor or outdoor use.</li><li>Your preferred colours or lighting effect.</li><li>The location where the sign will be displayed and whether installation is needed.</li></ul></section>
    <section class="content-card"><h2>Ordering from Manchester Sign Group</h2><p>We are based in Manchester and offer delivery throughout the United Kingdom. Delivery and any installation arrangements are confirmed according to the individual project. Request a quote to discuss the sign design, specification and estimated cost.</p><p>All products include a one-year warranty.</p></section>
    <div class="page-actions"><a href="/quote/">REQUEST A QUOTE →</a><a class="secondary" href="/services/">VIEW ALL SERVICES →</a></div>
    <nav class="related"><strong>Explore other sign types</strong><a href="/3d-signs/">3D signs</a><a href="/neon-signs/">Neon signs</a><a href="/flat-signs/">Flat signs</a></nav>
  </main>
</Layout>
<style>
.inner-page{width:min(900px,92%);margin:auto;padding:65px 0 85px}.page-head{max-width:760px;margin-bottom:28px}.page-head small{color:#ff1730;font-size:11px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:3px}.page-head h1{font-size:clamp(42px,8vw,72px);letter-spacing:-3px;line-height:1;margin:10px 0 14px}.page-head h1 em{font-style:normal;color:#ff1730}.page-head p,.content-card p,.content-card li{color:#aaa;line-height:1.75;font-size:15px}.content-card{padding:22px 24px;margin:14px 0;background:#0c0f11;border:1px solid #303437;border-radius:12px}.content-card h2{font-size:21px;margin:0 0 12px}.content-card p:last-child{margin-bottom:0}.content-card ul{padding-left:20px}.content-card li{padding:4px 0}.page-actions{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:22px}.page-actions a{padding:15px 18px;border-radius:8px;background:#ff1730;color:#fff;text-decoration:none;font-size:12px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:.5px}.page-actions .secondary{background:transparent;border:1px solid #444}.related{display:flex;gap:16px;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;margin-top:28px;padding-top:22px;border-top:1px solid #303437}.related strong{width:100%;font-size:13px}.related a{color:#ff6677;font-size:13px}@media(max-width:600px){.inner-page{padding:45px 0 65px}.content-card{padding:18px}.content-card h2{font-size:19px}.page-head h1{font-size:46px}}
</style>